---
description: Keep the API handlers, openapi.yaml, and the frontend client in sync
globs: src/**,openapi.yaml
alwaysApply: false
---

- `openapi.yaml` is the contract shared with the frontend repo (multi-repo-project-a).
  Every route in `src/app.js` must be documented there, and every documented route must exist.
- Any change to a request or response shape needs a matching change to
  `public/api.js` in multi-repo-project-a. Make both changes in the same task.
- Errors are JSON objects shaped `{ "error": "<message>" }` with a 4xx status.
- Every route needs at least one test in `test/app.test.js`.
